  "section": null,
  "number": "146",
  "title": "用电功率表示电功",
  "printed_title": "**146. 用电功率表示电功**",
  "start_page": 370,
  "start_printed": 359,
  "figures": [],
  "exercise_count": 6,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在各种用电器的说明书中，就象在电灯、电炉、电动机等上面一样，都标明用电器的电功率. 利用公式 $P=\\frac{A}{t}$，就可以根据电功率计算出在一段时间 $t$ 内的电功. 由这个公式可导出",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 359,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0370#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$A=Pt$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 359,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0370#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "以瓦特为单位表示电功率，以秒为单位表示时间，则所得的功的单位为焦耳：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 359,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0370#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**$1$ 瓦特$=\\frac{1\\text{ 焦耳}}{1\\text{ 秒}}$，所以 $1$ 焦耳$=1$ 瓦特$\\times1$ 秒.**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 359,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0370#13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在实践中为了计算上的方便，通常不用焦耳做单位来表示电功，而是使用其它的单位：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 359,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0370#14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**$1$ 瓦特小时$=3600$ 焦耳；****$1$ 百瓦小时$=100$ 瓦特$\\times1$ 小时$=360000$ 焦耳；****$1$ 千瓦小时$=1000$ 瓦特$\\times1$ 小时$=3600000$ 焦耳.**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 359,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0370#15",
        "p0371#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "知道了电灯的额定电功率及点燃的时数，就可以算出电功.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 360,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0371#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例如，一盏电灯的额定电功率是 100 瓦特，每天点燃 6小时. 试求这盏灯在一个月 (30 天) 内所消耗的电功.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 360,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0371#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "利用公式",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 360,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0371#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$A=Pt$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 360,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0371#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "得 $A=100$ 瓦特$\\times180$ 小时$=18000$ 瓦特小时$=18$ 千瓦小时.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 360,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0371#6"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
